---
layout: base.njk
title: Galeri
description: "Dokumentasi foto kegiatan {{ site.nama_organisasi }}."
permalink: /galeri/
---
<section class="hero" style="padding-bottom:8px;">
  <div class="wrap" style="grid-template-columns:1fr; padding-bottom:40px;">
    <span class="eyebrow-note">Galeri</span>
    <h1>Dokumentasi kegiatan dalam foto</h1>
    <p class="lead measure-wide">Kumpulan foto yang menggambarkan keterlibatan Karang Taruna dalam kegiatan sosial dan kemasyarakatan.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="divider" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 400 14" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M0 7 Q 10 0 20 7 T 40 7 T 60 7 T 80 7 T 100 7 T 120 7 T 140 7 T 160 7 T 180 7 T 200 7 T 220 7 T 240 7 T 260 7 T 280 7 T 300 7 T 320 7 T 340 7 T 360 7 T 380 7 T 400 7" stroke="#1f4d3a" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/></svg></div>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="placeholder-note">Admin: tambah/ganti foto lewat panel admin (CMS) — tidak perlu edit kode.</p>
    <div class="gallery-grid">
      {% for g in galeri.items %}
      <div class="gallery-item">
        <div class="gallery-photo">
          {% if g.gambar %}
          <img src="{{ g.gambar }}" alt="{{ g.judul }}" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;">
          {% else %}
          <svg width="52" height="52" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="1.5" stroke="#1f4d3a" stroke-width="1.4"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="10" r="1.6" stroke="#1f4d3a" stroke-width="1.2"/><path d="M4 17l5-5 4 4 3-3 4 4" stroke="#1f4d3a" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="gallery-caption"><strong>{{ g.judul }}</strong>{{ g.tanggal }} — {{ g.deskripsi }}</div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
